OL,3,GNEWSADriver denies causing mum and
OL,4,Adaughter's deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of racing a motorist
OL,7,Fmoments before the other vehicle struck
OL,8,Fand killed a mother and daughter has
OL,9,Fdenied charges of causing their deaths
OL,10,Fby dangerous driving.
OL,12,FJustyna Hulboj, 27, and four-year-old
OL,13,FLena Czepczor were hit by an Audi TT on
OL,14,Fthe pavement on Scott Hall Road in
OL,15,FLeeds while walking to nursery on 16
OL,16,FJanuary 2023.
OL,18,FJasskamal Riyat, 37, was driving a BMW
OL,19,F1 Series closely behind the Audi and is
OL,20,Fon trial at Leeds Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
