OL,3,GNEWSADriver denies causing mum and
OL,4,Adaughter's deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the Audi, Hardeep Bachu,
OL,7,Fhas already pleaded guilty to the same
OL,8,Foffences and will be sentenced after
OL,9,FRiyat's trial.
